            "title": "Trump threatens ABC: Why telecom sector faces a 'bigger threat'",
            "description": "<p>President Trump has threatened to sue Disney-owned (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/DIS\">DIS</a>) ABC following comments from Jimmy Kimmel after his late-night show was reinstated after a brief suspension that sparked free speech debates.</p>\n<p>Pangaea Policy founder Terry Haines outlines the business impact of Trump's threats for broadcasters and telecommunication providers.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
